<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive">
  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
  <title>해외 IP 접속 안내 | KDB생명</title>
  <!-- CSP는 실제 차단 응답의 HTTP 헤더에서 설정합니다. -->
  <style>
    html {
      font-family: "맑은 고딕", "Malgun Gothic", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", sans-serif;
      color: #24364b;
      background: #f5f7fa;
      line-height: 1.7;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    header, main, section, footer { display: block; }
    html { -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body { margin: 0; padding: 32px 20px; font-size: 18px; }
    .page { width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .brand { margin-bottom: 24px; text-align: center; }
    .brand-logo {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 200px;
      max-width: 100%;
      height: 78px;
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      image-rendering: auto;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .notice {
      padding: 32px 40px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #dce3eb;
      border-top: 4px solid #005a9c;
      border-radius: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(24, 49, 77, 0.05);
    }
    .icon {
      position: relative;
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: #c62828;
      background: #fff1f1;
    }
    .icon svg {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      top: 14px;
      left: 14px;
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
    }
    h1, h2, p { margin: 0; }
    h1 {
      color: #172f4b;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      word-break: keep-all;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .reason { margin-top: 20px; }
    .guidance { margin-top: 12px; }
    .guidance strong { color: #004b87; font-weight: 700; }
    .detail { margin-top: 10px; color: #526174; font-size: 16px; }
    .contact {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      border: 1px solid #bfd3e5;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #f2f7fc;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .contact h2 { color: #172f4b; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .contact dl { margin: 12px 0; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 18px; }
    .contact dl + dl { margin-top: -6px; }
    .contact dt, .contact dd {
      display: inline-block;
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      vertical-align: baseline;
    }
    .contact dd { margin-left: 8px; }
    .phone { color: #004b87; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 700; }
    .request { padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #cbdbe9; }
    .request strong { color: #004b87; }
    .closing { margin-top: 22px; color: #526174; font-size: 15px; }
    footer {
      padding-top: 20px;
      color: #596779;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: center;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .fixed-line { display: block; white-space: nowrap; }
    h1 { white-space: nowrap; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body { padding: 20px 12px; }
      .brand { margin-bottom: 16px; }
      .brand-logo { width: 180px; height: 70px; }
      .notice { padding: 24px 18px; border-radius: 12px; }
      .icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
      .icon svg { top: 10px; left: 10px; }
      .reason { margin-top: 16px; }
      .contact { margin-top: 20px; padding: 18px 14px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 512px) {
      h1 { font-size: calc(4.879001vw - 3.024980px); }
    }
    @media (min-width: 601px) and (max-width: 607px) {
      .reason { font-size: calc(3.704801vw - 4.519858px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 547px) {
      .reason { font-size: calc(3.704801vw - 2.296977px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 539px) {
      .guidance { font-size: calc(3.767330vw - 2.335744px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 499px) {
      .detail { font-size: calc(3.659251vw - 2.268735px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 491px) {
      .contact dl { font-size: calc(4.509380vw - 4.148629px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 483px) {
      .request { font-size: calc(4.602356vw - 4.234168px); }
    }
    @media (min-width: 601px) and (max-width: 671px) {
      .closing { font-size: calc(2.730897vw - 3.331695px); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .closing { font-size: calc(2.730897vw - 1.693156px); }
    }
    @media (-ms-high-contrast: active) {
      .notice, .contact { border: 1px solid WindowText; }
      .icon { color: WindowText; }
    }
    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      .notice, .contact { border: 1px solid CanvasText; }
      .icon { color: CanvasText; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="brand">
      <!-- 400x156 optimized PNG displayed at 200x78 (2x density) -->
      <img class="brand-logo" width="200" height="78" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="산업은행계열 KDB생명">
    </header>

    <main class="notice" aria-labelledby="notice-title">
      <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
             stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"
             stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false">
          <path d="M24 5 39 11v12c0 10-7 16-15 20C16 39 9 33 9 23V11Z" />
          <path d="m17 24 5 5 10-11" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1 id="notice-title">해외 IP에서의 접속이 제한되었습니다.</h1>

      <p class="reason">
        <span class="fixed-line">고객님의 안전한 금융거래와 개인정보 보호를 위해</span>
        <span class="fixed-line">해외 IP에서의 홈페이지 접속을 제한하고 있습니다.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="guidance">
        <span class="fixed-line">해외에서 홈페이지 이용이 필요한 고객께서는</span>
        <span class="fixed-line"><strong>KDB생명 고객센터를 통해 해외 IP 접속 예외 신청 후</strong></span>
        <span class="fixed-line">이용해 주시기 바랍니다.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="detail">
        <span class="fixed-line">해외 체류 등 정상적인 사유로 접속이 필요한 경우</span>
        <span class="fixed-line">고객센터 상담원을 통해 본인확인 및 접속 예외절차를</span>
        <span class="fixed-line">안내받으실 수 있습니다.</span>
      </p>

      <section class="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <h2 id="contact-title">KDB생명 고객센터<br>1588-4040</br></h2>
        <dl>
        </dl>
        <dl>
            <dt>운영시간 :</dt>
            <!-- 운영시간에는 기준 시간대도 함께 표기 -->
            <dd>평일 09:00 ~ 18:00 (KST, UTC+9)</dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="request">
         <tr>
         <td>IP 주소 : </td>
         <td>20.64.107.26</td>
         </tr>
          <dl>
          <span class="fixed-line">상담원에게 <strong>‘해외 IP 접속 예외 신청’</strong>을</span>
          <span class="fixed-line">요청해 주세요.</span>
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="closing">
        <span class="fixed-line">보다 안전한 금융서비스 제공을 위한 조치이오니 고객님의 양해 부탁드립니다.</span>
      </p>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p lang="en">Copyright © KDB Life Insurance Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>